"Main Gate"
"A gravel road leads to the north and south with granite walls to either side. 

Upon the walls rest a decrative symbol consisting of a shield, a sword, and a

crest.  A large gate is situated to the south keeping out unwanted visitors. 

A cool breeze blows in from above as there is no roof to this part of the

structure.  To one side of the gate there is a small metallic lever.

