#85004
"Gravel Path"
"The gravel path continues to the north and south, a gate visible in both

directions.  A nice fountain of pure water decoratively marks the center of

the area.  Beside the fountain sits a bench, inviting you to sit down and look

at the open sky above whilst listening to the calming sound of water from the

fountain.  The aroma of cooking food looms in from the doorway to the east.  A

sign next to the entrance indicates that the kitchen is beyond.  To the west,

the sign above the doorway tells you that these are the sleeping quarters.

"
