#85005
"Quarters"
"You have entered an elaborately decorated bedroom.  The owners of this abode

have put much time and thought into this room.  An immense fur rug covers the

floor of this room making you wonder what beast this might have been taken

from.  Many tapestries dot the walls, picturing many great battles and

quests.  Five pillowy feathered beds lie symmetrically inside this room, each

covered with silken bed sheets.  Doorways lie to the south and to the east,

each with heavy oak doors that push ever so gently open.

"
