#85006
"Kitchen"
"Stepping inside, you realize you have entered the kitchen, with enough space

and wares to feed all who come to visit.  Even the greatest chefs would be

envious of this kitchen.  The smells of freshly baked breads, simmering stew

and freshly cooked meats fill your senses.  Cupboards and countertops cover

all areas, and are filled with every spice and edible item known and unknown

to you.  Pots and pans hang from every nook and crannie.  An enormous stone

hearth lies at the center of this room, an essential item for any cook.  An

entryway to the south leads to a storage room whilst a large opening heads off

to the common room.  A western doorway leads outside to a gravel path.

"
""
