#85007
"Quarters"
"This appears to be the neatest bedroom you have ever visited.  Not a sheet out

of place or piece of clothing to be found lying around.  An extremely large,

elaborately decorated mirror dominates the southern wall.  Immaculately carved

dressers sit amongst the east and west walls, with enough drawers to contain

an army's belongings.  Five large fluffy beds dot the walls awaiting your

company.  A heavy oak door lies to the north; seemingly the only exit.

"
