#85008
"Storage"
"In this storage room many barrels crates and sacks are piled along the walls. 

From the ceiling hang many different kinds of meat and vegetables as well as

an oil lamp that is noticeably the only light source for the room.  Shelves

which are filled with many crucibles, small pots and flasks take up the

majority of the other wall space.  Even from the bars of the window hang some

small sacks with obviously edible contents.  Some barrels with beer and wine

are distributed amongst the other goods.  Only the center of the room remains

empty.  The only exit is back to the kitchen through the door to the north.

"
"barrels can only hold liquid, not very good for storage

