#85014
"Warleader Office"
"This room appears to be the room of a warrior.  Decorating the thick granite

walls are many maps of different regions of the lands.  On the massive oak

table rests a map with small tin knights and wooden orcs upon it.  The room is

lit only by an oil lamp that hangs from the ceiling.  In the north wall are

small gapes in the stone actings as windows.  A steel-banded door in the south

wall and an archway in the easter wall are the only exits.

